      "type": "narrative-update",
      "date": "2026-05-04T03:09:43.000Z",
      "title": "BAJFINANCE: Higher Margins And Dividend Outlook Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have trimmed their price target on Bajaj Finance by about ₹20 to roughly ₹1,059. This reflects updated views on fair value that balance a slightly different revenue growth outlook, an adjusted discount rate, a higher profit margin assumption and a lower future P/E multiple.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": "https://simplywall.st/community/narratives/in/diversified-financials/nse-bajfinance/bajaj-finance-shares/a7ii6a0g-analysts-adjust-bajaj-finance-price-target-amid-minor-valuation-shifts-and-upcoming-board-review/updates/17-analysts-have-trimmed-their-price-target-on-bajaj-finance-by",
